{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "7cd0b57daacbaf4607767e98d82b08cc5541564755eca5cb3d1e1803ba5415ea", "ja": "みんなの代表だぞ！", "zh": "是大家的代表喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5d1193ad93a361da90bd51cfbbb10b46c086bdaebb0e6e1dd69c7ef0a84a32c0", "ja": "映画の宣伝のため、テレビ局にやってきた\n星梨花と響。響の「みんなの代表」という\n言葉で桃子に言われたことを思い出すが、\n「自分らしく」頑張ろうと励まされ、笑顔で\nインタビューへと向かう。", "zh": "为了宣传电影，星梨花与响来到电视台。\n因为响的一句「大家的代表」，\n使星梨花想起桃子说过的话，\n但在受到鼓励要她「照自己的风格」加油后，\n她终于重拾笑容前往参加访谈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1af02f889a6b6e1b625a7ba14d12601ce5c08cf8ab1c1de581a5421e5c590ea1", "ja": "（今日はテレビ局で映画のインタビュー取材だ。\nいつもと違う仕事に、星梨花は目を輝かせている）", "zh": "（今天要在电视台接受电影的访谈。\n不同于以往的工作内容让星梨花的眼神闪闪发亮。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "0548fe39c35b1c43082933338d450c2a31da3382579bb959036eadf45b39c0da", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。\n今日の取材って、いろんなところで使われるんだよね？", "zh": "欸，{$P$}，\n今天的访谈会被用在很多地方对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a836779a6e2883a7b02df6d4554a033d1946326e5aaebee4d5168d053513c072", "ja": "ああ。いろんなテレビ番組で、映像が流れる予定だ。\nそれと、新聞や雑誌にも写真や記事が載るよ。", "zh": "是啊，影片预计会在很多电视节目上播出，\n另外报纸、杂志也会刊登照片跟报导喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "5290d552987addc54389f1036ad261748540cce44ce0d49753a5aee0db221e6f", "ja": "テレビに新聞に雑誌……\n映画のお仕事って、すごいんですね！", "zh": "电视、报纸、杂志……\n电影的工作真是厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "6ee96f458ec83564b9e23d7ad2c0f3c4e0c859c273ff96a1330011f37ccbeeef", "ja": "そうでしょ！　すごいでしょう！", "zh": "对吧！很厉害吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2f3ccf88b36a5006d989773f2678307d1f888a0c415b07dc4b4b441241e6f68d", "ja": "なんで響が自慢げなんだ？\nいや、いいけど……。", "zh": "为什么是响在自豪啊？\n算了，无所谓……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "64496c4ba65c3e253f0939500b01b3f0f390ec2f401e6932910c2aaf874f4380", "ja": "星梨花、いい？　映画って、出演する人もたくさん\nいるけど……スタッフの人たちの数も、すごいんだ！", "zh": "星梨花，听好啰！所谓的电影，不只有很多演员……\n工作人员的数量也非常多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "d85cf9aab9f130db7861e75a493ee68ed3de7aaf9ed70fd8b5ef3ac0edd08716", "ja": "みんなで一緒にがんばって、ひとつの映画を作る。\n自分たちは、そのみんなの代表なんだぞ！", "zh": "大家一起努力打造出一部电影，\n而我们就是大家的代表喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "a12a4dc472d2a418fd68b434d57f73c4169cf1b072678ebf024ca420b29d73fe", "ja": "みんなの、代表……。", "zh": "大家的代表……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "bbb5ad3b4a87353de504cb23f259998753ab5f00658efa1c0533352e1715b36d", "ja": "そう。映画を作ってる人たちの気持ちを伝える代表！\nだからこの映画のこと、いっぱい知ってもらおうね！", "zh": "没错，把电影制作团队的想法传递出去的代表！\n所以我们要努力打开这部电影的知名度喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "53f49e9bf21c69cc7c657b25ebd3663e7bb380e7532df91c026ebdaf8e69aaf6", "ja": "せ、星梨花？　自分、変なこと言っちゃった？", "zh": "星、星梨花？本人说了什么奇怪的话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "717e526b6fa9a47e07b3c86bcaedb60423f693af5826e68a9e02fcf9f50da7f2", "ja": "あっ……いえ、違うんです！\nただわたし、気になることがあって……。", "zh": "啊……没有，不是的！\n只是有件让我在意的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b76bc6f4e8218b667f6cff69ca3bf7f1abcb0d2690651718f6e1c675bb2852d8", "ja": "星梨花？", "zh": "星梨花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "50963aca93fcc57b1d9c14a13bc39a736e5b624bd898123f2224f3ec2f963e85", "ja": "わたし……主役としての自覚が足りないんでしょうか。\n少女役は、とっても大事なのに……。", "zh": "我身为主角……是不是还不够有自觉呢？\n少女这个角色明明那么重要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "da8cf53b8355cbdffd8e3d5967a532aa8b0fc950ae8de13553d3248d33154298", "ja": "確かに、主役は大事だけど……。\nえーっと、こういう時は……そうだ！", "zh": "虽然主角的确很重要……\n呃～这种时候……对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "955a69eb9cd56d9ef3603581da24b31c84cafa2e9df543c7561e417dee577010", "ja": "あのね、星梨花。リカが笑顔じゃないと、\nビッキーもすっごく心配すると思うんだ！", "zh": "那个啊，星梨花，莉卡失去笑容的话，\n毕奇应该会非常担心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "2567d3c26efe6384e77e0bda33f333297c3c6861f0fa9b2609147cfeda868336", "ja": "ビッキーが心配するってことは、\nジュニオールもすっごく心配するってことだぞ！", "zh": "毕奇如果担心，\n就代表朱尼奥尔也会非常担心喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "294fccc8bf79662ef1ed2d788552201cc3d8c76e8bec5f3bd485e1d3a3aa3bbe", "ja": "えっ……ジュニオールが？", "zh": "咦……朱尼奥尔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "8a2e3ded07e2fb338c7f8beece59d5bd9dc96e8ebc932c4e23321df3acaa641c", "ja": "だからね、笑顔じゃない星梨花は、\nダメじゃないんだけど、ダメっていうか……。", "zh": "所以呀，星梨花虽然并非不能没有笑容，\n但也不能没有笑容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "eacd1d0f0ca96f44908e4d3d1b0b8f857a1579cbd5480bff239458de54f9971d", "ja": "うう、自分、何を言おうとしたんだっけ……。\n{$P$}、なんとかしてよ～！", "zh": "唔唔，本人原本要说什么啊……\n{$P$}，你想想办法嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c6f7242370d4d08294a2734ccd0d8764b42c517709602145c179d6952c92e362", "ja": "ははは。響は、星梨花を励まそうと\nしてくれたんだよな。ありがとう！", "zh": "哈哈哈，响是想要鼓励星梨花吧？\n谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1022_p", "source_sha256": "195d38434858f0c45b1dc141a42149d71f5262f153f9e77496d6f7cf9913667e", "ja": "星梨花、確かに主人公は大事な役だ。\nでも桃子は、その後になんて言ったか覚えてるか？", "zh": "星梨花，主角确实是很重要的角色，\n不过你还记得桃子后来说了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "d92ec1eb3710e58d38ed70bc75e141a02ae4c3f94cb5c7a5ef22623eacffa396", "ja": "えっ？　そ、その後……ですか？", "zh": "咦？后、后来……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1024_013hib", "source_sha256": "4b0eee787447fa5fd9dda4252cf9966039481236b2b3978afc62b6cd66f14a4c", "ja": "たしか、『星梨花が少女役に選ばれた意味が、\nなくなっちゃう』……って言ってたよね？", "zh": "『不然你好不容易被选中饰演少女就没意义了』……\n本人记得她是这么说的对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1025_p", "source_sha256": "1483976076de483c90793b5ceaf5fa7e073ce8e66003358a0a095bc39bbf1d64", "ja": "ああ。言い方が少し厳しかったかもしれないけど、\n桃子はただ、星梨花を応援したかったんじゃないかな。", "zh": "没错，虽然桃子的用词可能严厉了一点，\n但她应该只是想为星梨花打气吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "bc9bc2485c5f78ea274eca28453eab1e1c234d2a66442248426faea31f7b47f3", "ja": "星梨花らしい少女役……主役を、\nみんなに見せられるように、頑張れって。", "zh": "她的本意是想鼓励你，\n希望你能照自己的风格演出少女……也就是主角。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "3835dd08109d7f726e0b3b203f5bc436d8862b0b00a11b31e48a63f8894fe5c8", "ja": "わたしらしい……主役……。", "zh": "有自我风格的……主角……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1028_p", "source_sha256": "bf0e8328e496140ca9b81c25f05e636a6500d51e9ad81d59a43cf240887ca3af", "ja": "それに、映画はみんなで一緒に作るんだから。星梨花は\n星梨花にしかできない事を、頑張ればいいんだよ。", "zh": "而且，电影是大家一起打造出来的，\n你只要努力做只有你才能办到的事就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1029_022ser", "source_sha256": "56c925b0ace5fe6b66d486085777aa49528a9929f9bfddc90247c09bbfb93c6d", "ja": "{$P$}さん……そうですね。\n映画は、わたしだけで作るものじゃないんですよね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……说得也是，\n电影不是我一个人拍出来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "b49c85e1d260cd8d9cfcff3dddc3be805f2a09c1726759f125cd92b844db5d98", "ja": "わたしの演じる『少女』は、主役ですけど。\nわたしはわたしらしく、がんばればいいんですね！", "zh": "我饰演的『少女』虽然是主角，\n但我只要照自己的风格去努力就行了，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1031_013hib", "source_sha256": "916660b565b6ba731d6ea43ad62a44a2f2b5203b1e6fe5ce9569cee2624b5ef8", "ja": "そうだぞ、星梨花！　でも油断してると、\n自分のオオカミが一番目立っちゃうかもしれないけど！", "zh": "没错喔，星梨花！但要是太大意，\n本人的大野狼可能会抢尽锋头唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_03_1032_022ser", "source_sha256": "916a1a516cf19809fbebe5c5a441f66963d9f578cc7630b2f3b638b95b377d7c", "ja": "えっ！？　そ、そんな……\nわ、わたしだって、ビッキーさんには負けません！", "zh": "咦！？怎、怎么可以……\n我、我是不会输给毕奇的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
